## Proposal: 3 Premium "Creative" Features

1. **The Panopticon (Real-Time Map Oversight)**
   Instead of a boring list of active users, the Moderator dashboard features a "God Mode" view of the World Map. It visualizes the real-time movement of all active players across sectors. LOREKEEPERS can click a sector and deploy a localized hazard directly on top of a cluster of active players, turning moderation into a live Dungeon Master experience.

2. **Ghost Protocol (Secure Impersonation Mode)**
   For debugging complex player-reported issues, OVERSIGHT MODERATORS can securely copy a player's exact `useGameStore` state vector into a local sandbox. They can "play" as that user's exact clone offline, reproduce the bug without risking the live player's actual data, and log the explicit fix required. 

3. **Construct OS Toxicity Subroutines (AI-Assisted Flagging)**
   Messages sent by players are asynchronously passed to the Edge Function AI. If the AI detects malicious harassment not caught by standard profanity filters, it flags the message and automatically alters the player's internal [Alignment](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/vortex/WebApp/src/types/index.ts#53-63) stat toward a hidden "Rogue" state, alerting OVERSIGHT MODERATORS on the dashboard for manual review.
